{1}{Hello there, mate.  Strange place to be out walkin'.  You mind tellin' me what you're doin' out here?}{Hello there, lassie.  Strange place to be out walkin'.  You mind tellin' me what you're doin' out here?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Yes.  I've come here to kill you...}{}{5}{gf2159 1}{15}{}
{3}{Actually, I might have a business proposition for you...}{}{5}{gf2159 1, al -500}{11}{}
{4}{Uh...just enjoying a leisurely stroll in the Fens...}{}{5}{gf2159 1}{7}{}
{7}{No one takes a leisurely stroll in the Dark Fens, mate.  Out with it, or you'll be answerin' to me...}{No one takes a leisurely stroll in the Dark Fens, lassie.  Out with it, or you'll be answerin' to me...}{}{}{}{}
{8}{If you must know, I'm here to kill you...}{}{5}{}{15}{}
{11}{Really?  And what might that be?}{Really?  And what might that be?}{}{}{}{}
{12}{I know the location of the Bedokaan camp...}{}{5}{}{25}{}
{15}{Is that so? [He eyes you warily, gesturing to his comrades.]  Might I ask you why?}{Is that so? [He eyes you warily, gesturing to his comrades.]  Might I ask you why?}{}{}{}{}
{16}{I've been sent here by the Bedokaan...}{}{5}{}{18}{}
{18}{Ha!  We've a bloody lizard-lover here boys!  Thought people like you only lived in the big cities, a'cryin' over the poor lizards, while yer wearin' boots made a' their worthless hides...}{Ha!  We've a bloody lizard-lover here boys!  Thought people like you only lived in the big cities, a'cryin' over the poor lizards, while yer wearin' boots made a' their worthless hides...}{}{}{}{}
{19}{Brave last words, murderer.  Prepare for death...}{}{5}{}{21}{}
{21}{[He laughs again, even louder.]  Look, mate.  I have a better idea.  Why don't you tell me where those lizards are, and I'll pay you a handsome fee...let's call it a thousand gold pieces?}{[He laughs again, even louder.]  Look, lassie.  I have a better idea.  Why don't you tell me where those lizards are, and I'll pay you a handsome fee...let's call it a thousand gold pieces?}{}{}{}{}
{22}{You must be joking.  I'll split your skull for even thinking it...}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 33}
{23}{Hmmm.  An interesting offer...what are the terms?}{}{5}{}{25}{}
{25}{Heh...I knew we were speakin' the same language.  The name's Robert Milton.  You give me the location of the lizard's camp, and we'll meet there.  If the lizards are all there, I'll pay you a thousand gold pieces...whaddaya say, mate?}{Heh...I knew we were speakin' the same language.  You give me the location of the lizard's camp, and we'll meet there.  If the lizards are all there, I'll pay you a thousand gold pieces...whaddaya say, lassie?}{}{}{}{}
{26}{Deal, Robert.  Here's where they are...[Show him on the map.]}{}{5}{}{29}{qu1079 6}
{27}{You stupid bastard, Milton.  I'd never betray the Bedokaan!}{}{5}{}{}{co, fl 33}
{29}{Very good.  We'll meet you there...if they're really there, you'll be makin' a fair coin...}{Very good.  We'll meet you there...if they're really there, you'll be makin' a fair coin...}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
{30}{E:}{}{5}{}{-5}{}
{33}{Ha!  We'll skin you too, mate!  Get 'im, boys!}{Ha!  We'll skin you too, lassie!  Get 'er, boys!}{}{}{}{}
